WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.367
Permits: no start before the township approves.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:07.600
Open a job. Permits are kept on the job.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:20.433
The job folder. Tick "Needs a township permit" and fill in the township and dates. The crew can't start until you press "Mark the permit approved"; the job shows a lock on the schedule meanwhile.

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:26.533
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
